### ==========================================================================
### PHASE 1: IDENTITY, JWT SESSIONS & HYBRID AUTH
### ==========================================================================

### 1. Register Super Admin User
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@omninode.io",
  "password": "SuperSecurePassword2026!",
  "role": 0,
  "organizationName": "OmniNode Global Headquarters",
  "agencyId": null
}

### 2. Register Agency Owner User (Starts as PendingPayment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@velocityintegrations.com",
  "password": "AgencyOwnerPass2026!",
  "role": 1,
  "organizationName": "Velocity Integrations Agency",
  "agencyId": null
}

### 3. Register Standalone Tenant User (Self-Serve Merchant)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "basel@ammanbakery.com",
  "password": "MerchantPass2026!",
  "role": 2,
  "organizationName": "Amman Artisan Bakery",
  "agencyId": null
}

### 4. Login - Super Admin Session (Copy 'token' to @superAdminToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@omninode.io",
  "password": "SuperSecurePassword2026!"
}

### 5. Login - Agency Owner Session (Copy 'token' to @agencyToken & 'agencyId' to @agencyId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@velocityintegrations.com",
  "password": "AgencyOwnerPass2026!"
}

### 6. Login - Merchant Session (Copy 'token' to @merchantToken & 'tenantId' to @merchantTenantId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "basel@ammanbakery.com",
  "password": "MerchantPass2026!"
}

### 7. Verify Caller Profile & Permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}


### ==========================================================================
### PHASE 2: MANUAL BILLING LIFECYCLE (CLIQ / WIRE / CASH)
### ==========================================================================

### 8. Agency Generates CliQ Invoice for Subscription Renewal
POST {{baseUrl}}/Billing/generate-invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 249.00,
  "currency": "JOD",
  "paymentMethod": "CliQ"
}

### 9. Standalone Merchant Generates Bank Wire Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/Billing/generate-invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 49.00,
  "currency": "JOD",
  "paymentMethod": "BankWire"
}

### 10. Super Admin Approves Invoice & Activates Agency (Pass @invoiceId from #8)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Billing/approve-invoice/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}


### ==========================================================================
### PHASE 3: AGENCY FLEET MANAGEMENT & SUB-TENANT PROVISIONING
### ==========================================================================

### 11. View Agency Dashboard Overview (Quota & Sub-Tenant Utilization)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Agencies/my-agency
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}

### 12. Agency Provisions Sub-Tenant (Client 1: Retail Client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Agencies/sub-tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luxury Perfumes Retail",
  "ownerEmail": "client1@perfumery.com",
  "allocatedTaskQuota": 5000,
  "allocatedAiQuota": 250
}

### 13. Agency Provisions Sub-Tenant (Client 2: Pizza Delivery)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Agencies/sub-tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rabyeh Fast Pizza",
  "ownerEmail": "orders@fastpizza.jo",
  "allocatedTaskQuota": 3500,
  "allocatedAiQuota": 500
}

### 14. List All Sub-Tenants Under Agency Umbrella
GET {{baseUrl}}/Agencies/sub-tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}

### 15. Update Sub-Tenant Quotas Dynamically
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Agencies/sub-tenants/{{subTenantId}}/quotas
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monthlyTaskQuota": 12000,
  "aiTasksQuota": 750
}

### 16. Generate Automated Ingestion API Key for Sub-Tenant (Copy output to @tenantApiKey)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Tenants/{{subTenantId}}/generate-key
X-Api-Key: {{masterKey}}


### ==========================================================================
### PHASE 4: MACHINE PIPELINE CONFIGURATION (SOURCE -> CRM MAPPINGS)
### ==========================================================================

### 17. Create Source Endpoint (Shopify E-Commerce Store)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Endpoints
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platformName": "Shopify",
  "endpointType": "Source",
  "webhookUrl": "https://omni.mohammad-abujalboush.com/api/webhooks/structured/will-be-assigned",
  "authHeaders": ""
}

### 18. Create Destination Endpoint (HubSpot CRM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Endpoints
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platformName": "HubSpot",
  "endpointType": "Destination",
  "webhookUrl": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/deals",
  "authHeaders": "Bearer"
}

### 19. Create Destination Auth Credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/Credentials
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpointId": "{{destEndpointId}}",
  "baseUrl": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/deals",
  "apiKey": "test_hubspot_token_live_or_sandbox",
  "authType": "Bearer"
}

### 20. Establish Active Connection Between Source and Destination
POST {{baseUrl}}/Connections
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceEndpointId": "{{sourceEndpointId}}",
  "destinationEndpointId": "{{destEndpointId}}",
  "status": "Active",
  "baseUrl": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/deals",
  "apiKey": "test_hubspot_token_live_or_sandbox",
  "authType": "Bearer"
}

### 21. Configure Field Mappings (JSONB Engine with Math Rules)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Mappings/configure
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connectionId": "{{connectionId}}",
  "rules": [
    {
      "endpointId": "{{sourceEndpointId}}",
      "sourceKey": "customer.first_name",
      "targetKey": "firstname",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "endpointId": "{{sourceEndpointId}}",
      "sourceKey": "total_price",
      "targetKey": "amount",
      "type": "number",
      "math": "/100"
    }
  ]
}


### ==========================================================================
### PHASE 5: REAL-TIME INGESTION, AI PARSING & QUOTA GUARDS
### ==========================================================================

### 22. Ingest Standard Structured Webhook (Shopify Order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/structured/{{sourceEndpointId}}
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "10029384",
  "customer": {
    "first_name": "Tariq",
    "email": "tariq@example.jo"
  },
  "total_price": "7500"
}

### 23. Ingest Unstructured AI Webhook (WhatsApp Conversational Order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/unstructured/{{sourceEndpointId}}?userId=962795551234
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Marhaba, I need 2 boxes of luxury amber perfume sent to Abdoun, Amman. Phone is 0795551234."
}

### 24. Test Quota Exhaustion / 429 Sentinel (Verification)
# Note: When TasksUsedThisMonth reaches MonthlyTaskQuota, this endpoint must reject with HTTP 429
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/structured/{{sourceEndpointId}}
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "99999999",
  "customer": { "first_name": "QuotaBreaker" },
  "total_price": "100"
}


### ==========================================================================
### PHASE 6: OBSERVABILITY, AUDIT LOGS, DLQ & SUPER ADMIN CONTROL
### ==========================================================================

### 25. Tenant/Agency Views Ingestion Log History
GET {{baseUrl}}/Events/logs
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}

### 26. Tenant/Agency Inspects Pending Processing Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/Events/pending
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}

### 27. Tenant/Agency Inspects Failed Deliveries
GET {{baseUrl}}/Events/failed
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}

### 28. Super Admin Mission Control - Telemetry Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/Admin/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 29. Super Admin Mission Control - Global Agency Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/Admin/agencies
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 30. Super Admin Mission Control - Inspect Global Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Admin/dead-letter-queue?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 31. Super Admin Bulk Reprocessor (Re-queue all failed CRM payloads)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Admin/reprocess-failed
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 32. Cascade Deletion Teardown (Removes source endpoint, connections & rules)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Endpoints/{{sourceEndpointId}}
X-Api-Key: {{tenantApiKey}}